From 60880244e433d5d36d5d01eefb6ef858d106eb5b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: forge-shepherd <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 4 Jul 2026 17:34:37 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add auto-merge safety guards (no_conflicts, not_draft,
 state pre-flight, TOCTOU re-check)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Two new fail-closed rules — no_conflicts (mergeStateStatus DIRTY /
mergeable CONFLICTING) and not_draft — plus command-layer safety:
defaultFetchPrContext now exposes conflicting/isDraft/state from
gh pr view; a pre-flight guard makes an already merged/closed PR a
graceful no-op (idempotent re-runs); and the live TOCTOU re-check
(re-fetch + re-evaluate before mergePr) is covered by a test.
Documents auto_update / required-checks scoping / merge method /
branch-delete as follow-ups.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
